+  #
+  # The generic BDS only signals ReadyToBoot inside EfiBootManagerBoot(), so a
+  # firmware hook that waits for it never runs when no boot option can be
+  # started -- the exact case that ends in PlatformBootManagerUnableToBoot() and
+  # the grey screen. onyx therefore hands off from PlatformBootManagerAfterConsole()
+  # itself, which BDS calls once per boot before it looks at any boot option.
+  #
+  DeviceBootManagerLib|onyxPkg/Library/DeviceBootManagerLib/DeviceBootManagerLib.inf
+
